<mxCell id="note1" value="Note:&lt;br&gt;- «include»: the included use case always runs as part of the base use case.&lt;br&gt;- «extend»: e-Sign runs only at extension point Approve, when the verification request is approved.&lt;br&gt;- Grey actors are external systems / time actor." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#b0a000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="1370" width="340" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
